# Bot User Journeys

Use these numbers when discussing or changing bot behavior. Buttons are denoted in square brackets. `[Back to Menu]` should be available as a wide bottom-row button from every non-main-menu screen and should return to the current week summary with main menu buttons.

1. `/start` -> Output current week summary -> Show main menu (`[🏠 Now]`, `[🛏️ Now]`, `[⏰ Past]`, `[🎯 Goals]`, `[📊 Reports]`)
2. `[🏠 Now]` -> Insert new home record now -> Output home week progress
3. `[🛏️ Now]` -> Insert new bed record now -> Output bed week progress
4. `[⏰ Past]` -> `[🏠 Yesterday]` -> Enter `HH:MM` -> Insert home record for yesterday -> Output yesterday's home week progress
5. `[⏰ Past]` -> `[🛏️ Yesterday]` -> Enter `HH:MM` -> Insert bed record for yesterday -> Output yesterday's bed week progress
6. `[⏰ Past]` -> `[🏠 Other]` -> Enter `dd.mm.yyyy HH:MM`, `dd.mm HH:MM`, or `HH:MM` (today, with logical-day cutoff) -> Insert home record for that date -> Output that week's home progress
7. `[⏰ Past]` -> `[🛏️ Other]` -> Enter `dd.mm.yyyy HH:MM`, `dd.mm HH:MM`, or `HH:MM` (today, with logical-day cutoff) -> Insert bed record for that date -> Output that week's bed progress
8. `[🎯 Goals]` -> Output home and bed last-weeks reports separated by `===============` -> Show `[🏠 Set]`, `[🛏️ Set]`, and `[Back to Menu]`
9. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🏠 Set]` -> Output current home week progress; if current goal is missing and previous week exists, show recommended `Goal: HH:MM (auto)` without saving -> Show `[Auto]` when available and `[Back to Menu]`
10. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🛏️ Set]` -> Output current bed week progress; if current goal is missing and previous week exists, show recommended `Goal: HH:MM (auto)` without saving -> Show `[Auto]` when available and `[Back to Menu]`
11. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🏠 Set]` -> `[Auto]` -> Save recommended home goal -> Output current home week progress
12. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🛏️ Set]` -> `[Auto]` -> Save recommended bed goal -> Output current bed week progress
13. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🏠 Set]` -> Enter `HH:MM` -> Save current home week goal -> Output current home week progress
14. `[🎯 Goals]` -> `[🛏️ Set]` -> Enter `HH:MM` -> Save current bed week goal -> Output current bed week progress
15. `[Back to Menu]` from any non-main-menu screen -> Output current week summary -> Show main menu
16. `[📊 Reports]` -> Short intro -> Show `[🏠 This week]`, `[🛏️ This week]`, `[🏠 All]`, `[🛏️ All]`, `[Export]`, and `[Back to Menu]`
17. `[📊 Reports]` -> `[🏠 This week]` -> Output WeekDetailsText for current home week -> Show `[Back to Reports]` and `[Back to Menu]` on one row
18. `[📊 Reports]` -> `[🛏️ This week]` -> Output WeekDetailsText for current bed week -> Show `[Back to Reports]` and `[Back to Menu]` on one row
19. `[📊 Reports]` -> `[🏠 All]` -> Output ActivityWeeksReportText for all home weeks with data -> Show `[Back to Reports]` and `[Back to Menu]` on one row
20. `[📊 Reports]` -> `[🛏️ All]` -> Output ActivityWeeksReportText for all bed weeks with data -> Show `[Back to Reports]` and `[Back to Menu]` on one row
21. `[📊 Reports]` -> `[Export]` -> Generate JSON export of all user data -> Send downloadable file -> Output confirmation -> Show `[Back to Reports]` and `[Back to Menu]` on one row
